=== POST-GATE FIX ===
Added LF normalization in TestEmitMatchesGolden so the golden test stays
green on Windows clients with core.autocrlf=true (which converts LF to
CRLF on checkout). The emitter and TestEmitDeterministic remain strictly
byte-exact; only the on-disk golden comparison normalizes line endings
because git can rewrite them out from under the test.

